1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,560
 Still, like Nephi, I do not know the meaning of all things.

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:08,160
 When I spoke at Ryan's funeral, I looked at his wife, Carrie, and their four children

3
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:12,660
 with such a heavy heart and said, "I don't understand why this happened.

4
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:13,660
 I don't."

5
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:19,760
 But let me be clear, not understanding is not the same as not believing.

6
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:25,080
 I may not understand everything, but I absolutely believe God sees you, loves you, and knows

7
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:27,080
 your story.

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:29,440
 A story that is both personal and purposeful.

